on><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"d5, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"e5, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"f5, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"g5, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"h5, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"a4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"b4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"c4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"d4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"e4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"f4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"g4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"h4, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"a3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"b3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"c3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"d3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"e3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"f3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"g3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"h3, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"a2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"b2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"c2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"d2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"e2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"f2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"g2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"h2, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"a1, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"b1, your knight\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ds-chess-piece ds-white\"><path d=\"M12 36c.5-7 5-11 10-15l-5 2-6-4 6-9 6-3 2-4 3 5c7 3 8 12 6 19l-2 9z\"/><path d=\"M23 12c6 2 7 7 5 13M17 16l-2 3M21 31h11\" class=\"ds-piece-detail\"/><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.2\" class=\"ds-piece-eye\"/><path d=\"M11 36h23l1.5 4H9.5z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"c1, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"d1, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"e1, your king\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ds-chess-piece ds-white\"><path d=\"M20.5 3h4v4H29v4h-4.5v5h-4v-5H16V7h4.5z\"/><path d=\"M22.5 18c-6-7-13-3-11 3l6 9h10l6-9c2-6-5-10-11-3z\"/><path d=\"M17 30h11l3 6H14z\"/><path d=\"M16 26h13M18 32h9\" class=\"ds-piece-detail\"/><path d=\"M11 36h23l1.5 4H9.5z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"f1, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square ds-dark\" aria-label=\"g1, empty\"></button><button class=\"ds-square\" aria-label=\"h1, empty\"></button></div><div class=\"ds-player ds-bottom\">You <span class=\"ds-active\">Your turn</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-table{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:600px;padding:10px 12px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--deep,#183e38);color:var(--ivory,#e8ead3);box-shadow:0 10px 25px #0000000d}.ds-player{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:38px;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.ds-player span{font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:var(--sage,#91af94)}.ds-bottom{margin:6px 0 0}.ds-player .ds-active{color:var(--yellow,#f3cf70);font-weight:700}.ds-board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,minmax(0,1fr));aspect-ratio:1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:3px}.ds-square{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;aspect-ratio:1;min-width:0;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--ivory,#e8ead3);cursor:pointer}.ds-dark{background:var(--sage,#91af94)}.ds-square:hover::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:#ffffff14;pointer-events:none}.ds-square:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--board-focus,#87640d);outline-offset:-3px;z-index:3}.ds-chess-piece{width:88%;height:88%;overflow:visible;pointer-events:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 1px #00000022);--piece-fill:#fffefa;--piece-stroke:#193b35;--piece-detail:#265b4d;fill:var(--piece-fill);stroke:var(--piece-stroke);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-chess-piece.ds-black{--piece-fill:#193b35;--piece-stroke:#102a24;--piece-detail:#c9d6bf}.ds-piece-detail{fill:none;stroke:var(--piece-detail);stroke-width:1.25}.ds-piece-eye{fill:var(--piece-detail);stroke:none}.ds-chess-piece.ds-concealed{width:78%;height:78%;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 1px #0000001a)}.ds-secret-mark{fill:none;stroke:var(--piece-detail);stroke-width:1.9}.ds-secret-inset{fill:none;stroke:var(--piece-detail);opacity:.35;stroke-width:.8}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-table{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:9px}.ds-player{min-height:31px;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px}.ds-bottom{margin-top:4px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Match dock",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "move-mode-selected",
      "description": "Persistent compact controls below one concise game state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-match-status\" role=\"status\">Your move</div><nav class=\"ds-dock\" aria-label=\"Game actions\"><div class=\"ds-mode\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Move style\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Move</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Bluff</button></div><button class=\"ds-dock-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 22V3m0 1c5-4 9 4 14 0v10c-5 4-9-4-14 0\"/></svg><span>Challenge</span></button><button class=\"ds-dock-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6h12M9 12h12M9 18h12M3 6h.1M3 12h.1M3 18h.1\"/></svg><span>Moves</span></button><button class=\"ds-dock-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg><span>More</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-match-status{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:7px 10px;min-height:36px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#586e66);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-dock{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;padding:5px 0}.ds-mode{display:flex;flex:1;margin-right:3px;padding:3px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--line,#dce2d8)}.ds-mode button{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;flex:1;min-height:44px;padding:8px 13px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#193b35);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ds-mode button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--white,#fffefa);box-shadow:0 1px 3px #0000000a}.ds-mode button.ds-bluff-active{background:var(--yellow,#f3cf70);box-shadow:none}.ds-dock-action{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;min-width:60px;min-height:54px;padding:5px 8px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#586e66);cursor:pointer}.ds-dock-action span{font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.ds-dock-action:hover{background:var(--line,#dce2d8)}.ds-dock button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#c28a22);outline-offset:3px}.ds-dock button:disabled{opacity:.38;cursor:default}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-dock{gap:3px;padding-top:3px}.ds-mode button{padding:8px 11px}.ds-dock-action{min-width:55px;min-height:55px;padding:5px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "More sheet",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "sheet-mobile",
      "description": "Secondary tools use one quiet menu surface; full-width bottom sheet on phones.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\" aria-label=\"Game\"><h2>Game</h2><div class=\"ds-menu\"><button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 3H3v5m13-5h5v5M3 16v5h5m13-5v5h-5\"/></svg><span>Exit zen mode</span><small>On</small></button><button><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6h12M9 12h12M9 18h12M3 6h.1M3 12h.1M3 18h.1\"/></svg><span>Rules</span></button><button class=\"ds-danger\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 22V3m0 1c5-4 9 4 14 0v10c-5 4-9-4-14 0\"/></svg><span>Resign</span></button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;position:relative;max-width:480px;max-height:85dvh;overflow:auto;padding:28px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--paper,#f6f7f2);color:var(--ink,#193b35);box-shadow:0 18px 60px #00000044}.ds-sheet h2{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 28px 15px 0}.ds-menu{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin:5px -5px -4px}.ds-menu button{font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;width:100%;min-height:51px;padding:11px 10px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#193b35);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-menu button span{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-menu small{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#586e66)}.ds-menu button:hover{background:var(--line,#dce2d8)}.ds-menu button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#c28a22);outline-offset:3px}.ds-menu button.ds-danger{color:var(--danger,#a53c33);border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d8);border-radius:0;margin-top:7px;padding-top:15px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-sheet{max-width:100%;max-height:82dvh;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;padding:27px 22px max(24px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}.ds-sheet::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:9px;left:calc(50% - 17px);width:34px;height:3px;background:var(--sage,#91af94);border-radius:4px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Modern Board-Game Lounge",
    "overview": "A familiar, relaxed place to play chess with friends. The muted teal table, ivory and sage squares, and original Staunton-style chess silhouettes make the game recognizable immediately. Friendly Manrope lettering and softly rounded controls keep the experience neither cartoonish nor formal.\n\nThe board carries the visual weight. Setup keeps arrangement and the next action clear; active play defaults to zen with compact player rows, one state line, and a small action dock. Secondary tools and move history open on demand. Capture reveals remain a deliberate moment of emphasis.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A tactile teal table on warm paper.",
      "Recognizable Staunton pieces and shield-shaped concealed identities.",
      "Quiet controls with warm yellow selection, bluff, and turn cues.",
      "Centered zen play, with responsive sheets and a thumb-friendly dock."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Color Rule",
        "body": "Keep yellow tied to selection, bluff, turn, reveal-related emphasis, or a high-priority action on a dark surface.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep the board dominant, with compact player rows and one concise state line during play.",
      "**Do** default to zen, keep secondary controls in sheets, and preserve review and penalty actions in the dock.",
      "**Do** retain recognizable Staunton silhouettes and shield-shaped concealed identities.",
      "**Do** preserve keyboard focus, opaque handoff coverage, safe-area spacing, and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce cartoon mascots or formal tournament ornament.",
      "**Don't** use yellow as general surface decoration.",
      "**Don't** reveal an opponent's identity through a visual or accessibility label.",
      "**Don't** add slogans, a footer, stacked status cards, or an always-visible settings panel during zen play.",
      "**Don't** replace the restrained tone-and-border hierarchy with heavy shadows on every control."
    ]
  }
}
